              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 9:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Abisalomu abantu boonse ba-Israyeli bakati, Lulungunwido lwa-Husai mu-Ariki ndubotu kwiinda lulungunwido lwa-Ahitofeli. Nkaambo aya makani akazwa kuli-Jehova, ngonguwe wakazunda lulungunwido lubotu lwa-Ahitofeli kuti aletele Abisalomu bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Husai wakaambila Zadoki a-Abiyatara bapaizi kuti, Ahitofeli wakalungunwida Abisalomu abapati ba-Israyeli obo, pele mebo ndakabalungunwida obo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino amufwambaane kutuma kuyooambila Davida kuti, Utaoni sunu kucito cakunkanda, pe, kozubuka buyo, kuti batamenwi mwami abantu boonse mbaali abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
