          "text": "Mpawo balanda ba-Abisalomu nibakasika kumwanakazi kuŋanda, bakabuzya kuti, Bali kuli ba-Ahimaazi a-Jonatani? Mwanakazi wakati, Bazubuka kale mutala amulonga. Elyo bakaya bubalangaula, pele teebakabajana pe, aboobo bakapiluka ku-Jerusalemu.",
