        {
          "text": "Lino bainke buyo, bakazwa mucikala mubakabede, baakulwiida mwami Davida. Bakaambila Davida kuti, Amunyamuke, mufwambaane kuzubuka mutala amulonga, nkaambo mbuboobu Ahitofeli mbwaakalungununa aandinywe. ",
