              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Abisalomu wakabika Amasa mucibaka ca-Joabu mbuli silutwe wampi. Oyu Amasa kali-mwana wamuntu umwi mu-Israyeli, izina lyakwe kali Itra, kaswanene a-Abigayeli mwana musimbi wa-Nahasi mucizi wa-Zeruya banyina Joabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
